[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mA: Pure validator (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mvalidate() + rule helpers + valuesFromForm(). Pure, fully unit-testable, no guessed error-UI contract. Each form [39m
     [38;5;246mkeeps ~6 lines of glue.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m B: Validator + bindForm
     [38;5;246mAdds auto-wiring and error rendering. Most reuse per form, but invents an error-display contract with no second [39m
     [38;5;246mform to check it against.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m A now, B later
     [38;5;246mBuild A, and revisit bindForm once a real second form shows what its error UI needs.[39m
